{"id":"106479","t":{"th":"น้องโล่สายแทงก์แกร่งเกินร้อย","ro":"Itai no wa Iya nano de Bougyoryoku ni Kyokufuri Shitai to Omoimasu.","en":"BOFURI: I Don't Want to Get Hurt, so I'll Max Out My Defense.","na":"痛いのは嫌なので防御力に極振りしたいと思います。"},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx106479-JmPk1F5ubMtm.png","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx106479-JmPk1F5ubMtm.png","color":"#1ac9d6","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/106479-G1rExJ4m8Be3.jpg","fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":12,"dur":24,"season":"WINTER","year":2020,"start":"2020-01-08","country":"JP","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy","Slice of Life"],"score":73,"pop":186345,"studio":"SILVER LINK.","desc":"The story centers on Kaede Honjou, who is invited by her friend Risa Shiramine to play a virtual reality MMO game with her. While Kaede doesn't dislike games, what she really, truly dislikes is being in pain. She creates a character named Maple, and decides to put all her points in VIT to minimize pain. As a result, she moves slowly, can't use magic, and even a rabbit can get the best of her. However, as it turns out, she acquires a skill known as \"Absolute Defense\" as a result of her pumping points into VIT, as well as a \"Counter Skill\" that works against special moves. Now, with her ability to nullify all damage, she goes on adventures.","descTh":"เรื่องราวมีศูนย์กลางอยู่ที่ Kaede Honjou ซึ่งได้รับการเชิญจากเพื่อนของเธอ Risa Shiramine ให้เล่นเกม MMO เสมือนจริงกับเธอ แม้ว่าคาเอเดะจะไม่ชอบเกม แต่สิ่งที่เธอไม่ชอบจริงๆ ก็คือความเจ็บปวด เธอสร้างตัวละครชื่อ Maple และตัดสินใจนำคะแนนทั้งหมดของเธอไปไว้ใน VIT เพื่อลดความเจ็บปวด เป็นผลให้เธอเคลื่อนที่ช้าๆ ไม่สามารถใช้เวทย์มนตร์ได้ และแม้แต่กระต่ายก็สามารถดึงสิ่งที่ดีที่สุดจากเธอได้ อย่างไรก็ตาม ปรากฏว่าเธอได้รับทักษะที่เรียกว่า \"การป้องกันแบบสัมบูรณ์\" ซึ่งเป็นผลมาจากการสูบฉีดคะแนนเข้าสู่ VIT เช่นเดียวกับ \"ทักษะตอบโต้\" ที่ทำงานกับการเคลื่อนไหวพิเศษ ตอนนี้ด้วยความสามารถของเธอที่จะลบล้างความเสียหายทั้งหมด เธอจึงออกเดินทางผจญภัย","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":"licensor","descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":"2ji-cLcT-UI","al":"https://anilist.co/anime/106479","mal":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/38790","jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"bilibili","r":"TH","u":"https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/2100874","lang":"dub","eps":[["1","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/2100874/13145837",1707307200,"x","b:25a2ee33635b2f416afffaa3e9ec57360dc2374c.jpg",null,{"alt":[["https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/2076764/12715473",1673197200,"x"]]}],["2","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/2100874/13145980",1707307200,"x","b:7153abf1fc855204c40a149bc9be79829cc5fefb.jpg",null,{"alt":[["https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/2076764/12715531",1673197200,"x"]]}],["3","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/2100874/13146073",1707307200,"x","b:7ec2491c8033a9767d6b3057646e93b9fc5107c1.jpg",null,{"a":"premium","alt":[["https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/2076764/12715663",1673283600,"x"]]}],["4","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/2100874/13146146",1707307200,"x","b:efed380ecc38b0743adf2ffc3f9fc406049f3fd1.jpg",null,{"a":"premium","alt":[["https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/2076764/12715752",1673283600,"x"]]}],["5","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/2100874/13146277",1707307200,"x","b:48a20ff5414cc15b57067c8e1d06e9933625fc03.jpg",null,{"a":"premium","alt":[["https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/2076764/12715838",1673370000,"x"]]}],["6","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/2100874/13146369",1707307200,"x","b:e19dddc295fca69b447e99977b40f35e0e425681.jpg",null,{"a":"premium","alt":[["https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/2076764/12715934",1673370000,"x"]]}],["7","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/2100874/13146477",1707307200,"x","b:3b9a078f4fee98914202289be4988708e4ddda36.jpg",null,{"a":"premium","alt":[["https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/2076764/12716003",1673456400,"x"]]}],["8","https://www.bilibili.tv/th/play/2100874/13146543",1707307200,"x","b:ef812aa4a235476547514385cc020b3ce6457061.jpg",null,{"a":"premiu